hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16670","He said: Hajjaj narrated to us, he said: Shubah informed us, from Said al-Jurayri, from Abu al-Salil, from an old woman from Banu Numayr that she observed the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) while he was praying at al-Abtah facing the House before the Emigration. He said: She heard him saying: O Allah, forgive me my sin, my error, and my ignorance."
